  "documentation": "One person's authority to act for one patient. A patient nominates an angel (PENDING) who accepts (ACTIVE). Separately, a patient may name a STANDBY nominee and consent in advance that clinicians may activate them — which takes two different professionals, and still ends in the nominee accepting. Nothing here is ever deleted; ending a delegation records who ended it and when.",
